-## Subtopics
-
-### Extended Marching Cubes with No Degenerate Triangles
-Focuses on eliminating degenerate triangles that can arise from ambiguous cases, using a different approach to facetization. [Link](2186-extended-marching-cubes-with-no-degenerate-triangles.md)
-
-### Extended Marching Cubes Lookup Table
-Expands the standard lookup table to handle more cases, potentially including topological corrections. [Link](2187-extended-marching-cubes-lookup-table.md)
-
-### Contouring Discrete Indicator Functions
-A method for contouring discrete data, which may require different handling of topological issues. [Link](4087-contouring-discrete-indicator-functions.md)
-
-### 2D Reduction for 3D DIF Contouring
-Reduces 3D contouring problems to 2D, which can simplify topological checks. [Link](4301-2d-reduction-for-3d-dif-contouring.md)
-
-### Marching Cubes 33
-A variant that uses a 33-case lookup table to resolve ambiguities, including some topological issues. [Link](5986-marching-cubes-33.md)
